---
// StatusGrid Account & Data Deletion
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
  <title>Request Account &amp; Data Deletion — StatusGrid</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Guidelines and steps for users to request permanent deletion of their StatusGrid account, saved profiles, and personal data.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://utkarshkarale.github.io/statusgrid/delete-account">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/statusgrid-icon.png">

  <!-- Open Graph -->
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Request Account &amp; Data Deletion — StatusGrid">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Steps to delete your StatusGrid account and personal data.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://utkarshkarale.github.io/statusgrid/delete-account">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://utkarshkarale.github.io/statusgrid-icon.png">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --bg: #040d08;
      --paper: #081710;
      --ink: #e2f0e8;
      --muted: #8ca396;
      --emerald: #10b981;
      --line: #133324;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 620px;
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .logo {
      width: 68px;
      height: 68px;
      object-fit: contain;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.65rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .intro {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: #05130b;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .card h2 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--emerald);
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    }
    ul {
      margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    li { padding: 2px 0; }
    .email-box {
      background: #0c261b;
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      margin: 1.25rem 0;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--emerald);
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    a { color: var(--emerald); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .back-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <img src="/statusgrid-icon.png" alt="StatusGrid Logo" class="logo" />
    <h1>Request Account &amp; Data Deletion</h1>
    <p class="intro">You have full control over your personal information. Follow the instructions below to request permanent deletion of your StatusGrid account and all associated profile records.</p>
    
    <div class="card">
      <h2>How to submit a deletion request:</h2>
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Send an email from your registered StatusGrid email address to our data protection team at:</p>
      <div class="email-box">karaleutkarsh3696@gmail.com</div>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 0; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted);">Subject line: <strong>StatusGrid Account Deletion Request</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>What data will be deleted:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account credentials:</strong> Your user ID, email address, and authentication tokens.</li>
        <li><strong>Profile customization:</strong> Your saved name, title/designation, and phone or social media handles.</li>
        <li><strong>Profile photo:</strong> Any avatar or profile cutout stored in our backend.</li>
        <li><strong>Device push tokens:</strong> Notification tokens registered with FCM.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin:10px 0 0; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted);">All records are permanently removed from our Cloudflare D1 database and Firebase Authentication within <strong>24 to 48 hours</strong>.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <a href="/statusgrid" class="back-btn">&larr; Back to StatusGrid</a> &bull; 
      <a href="/statusgrid/privacy" class="back-btn">Privacy Policy</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
